d with water. Water is abundant throughout most of the known universe! There is liquid water on many planets. There is liquid water inside some comets. Hell, it snows on Mars! &gt;The moon's gravity affected the water in such manner that giant waves made organic molecules combine and form more complex microorganisms. Yup. Good thing moons are a relatively common feature among many planets too. Earth is NOT unique. It is, in fact, incredibly average!
